{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>rust基础语法</p>","expand":true,"uid":"76a4b168-b016-447d-a310-a055185a9a08","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{"smm_img_key_5a1d11f1-4fa2-4eba-a978-b8fd145e2cbd":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_9c2116e1-2d6d-4b51-a4d5-f088cfd3ac7d":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_cdb2d62d-f7c1-4283-877c-8f0e3a577e44":"data:image/png;base64,"},"customTextWidth":165,"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>基础类型</p>","generalization":[{"text":"<p>后面内容敲着记忆</p>","uid":"c6eab122-95d9-49c5-83b4-fc26e8b0378e","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false}],"uid":"6981fd38-9d4b-4b91-a22c-4fd9b3671fbc","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>赋值语句</p>","uid":"932e2d01-fdf2-4600-bec4-561e74af7f72","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>let 关键字</p>","uid":"b532d3f9-d5ba-4f3a-937d-222fd0f3c7de","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>fn main() {</p><p> </p><p> let a: u32 =1;</p><p> let b =0.1;</p><p> println!(\"Hello, world! {}\",a as f64 + b);</p><p>}</p><p><br></p>","uid":"45495c6b-4274-493d-8a91-9b2adb07973c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>let a = 10;</p><p>let mut a = 10;</p><p>let a = 11;</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"99cd9772-4b2b-4024-bac1-bce8ad32c6a7"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>会输出什么？</p>","uid":"c110a891-2756-491d-bd71-f0e687bb12b5","expand":false,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>a = 11</p>","uid":"bc012c2d-6ed9-4b47-bbbd-3a7410fa5174","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[],"ancestorGeneralizationNodeHeight":0.9090909090909091}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>rust是强类型静态类型语言，不允许进行隐式转换</p><p>可以允许cargo check检测语法</p><p><br></p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d3ee7a79-531f-4f9b-8011-34c470fdd13c","image":"smm_img_key_5a1d11f1-4fa2-4eba-a978-b8fd145e2cbd","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":501.8299549549549,"height":67.56756756756756,"custom":true}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>let a = 10;</p><p>执行的是变量绑定（所有权）</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"29c3f86c-4bdd-49df-8855-cb92dc369768"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>任何内存对象都有对应的地址，把这个变量绑定这个基础类型的地址</p>","uid":"77892d3e-abe5-454b-85bc-101d26959296","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>所有权概念？</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4eb51cf0-8c00-41df-9423-64c1b777d2cd","attachmentUrl":"/Users/trick/Desktop/github/rust/doc/xmind/所有权.smm","attachmentName":"所有权.smm"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>let s = Some(String::from(\"Hello!\"));</p><p><br></p><p>if let Some(_s) = s {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;println!(\"found a string\");</p><p>}</p><p><br></p><p>println!(\"{:?}\", s);</p>","uid":"fcb35cea-c605-405e-87ed-aa242be1b238","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>数字类型</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"5df5771e-0178-448c-a5b6-b31441ec069e"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>整数</p>","uid":"8dc8cd8d-d202-464c-a51f-156d7d6ee5fa","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>isize和usize和cpu架构位数有关</p><p>4字节和8字节</p><p>32。64</p><p><br></p><p>2的8次分</p>","uid":"5f9d900a-ef85-48c5-8862-38885f3ba486","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_9c2116e1-2d6d-4b51-a4d5-f088cfd3ac7d","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":348.3739853826397,"height":142.20131539009714,"custom":true}},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>bit？8bit等18字节</p><p>ASCII编码需要7-8bit表示一个字符</p><p>字节，现在为计算机的最小寻址单元</p><p>0-255？</p>","uid":"7c74ea83-7f3d-470b-a637-df1e8efb48b9","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>rust安全特性，在debug模式下会对整数溢出进行panic，认为是逻辑错误，显式声明</p><p>c里面进行静默回绕（直接丢弃高位，从0开始）</p><p>迫使你在编码时就思考边界情况，而不是等到生产环境出 bug</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"5f1b7287-a417-4727-aee3-7da9d996bbe5"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>有无字符</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4936a5d7-a7d1-4c4b-a776-f90031de81f4"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>是否用最高位来表示正负号</p>","uid":"c6898037-582e-4036-9510-4207d3720b11","expand":false,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p><br></p>","uid":"470369e2-ff4a-4908-9a7e-a553a168f269","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[],"ancestorGeneralizationNodeHeight":2.727272727272727}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>无符号（Unsigned，前缀 u）</p><p>所有 bit 都用来表示非负整数</p><p>范围：0 到 2ⁿ - 1</p><p>适用场景：计数、索引、位掩码、哈希值、协议字段</p><p>有符号（Signed，前缀 i）</p><p>最高位作为符号位（0=正，1=负），其余位用补码表示数值</p><p>范围：-2ⁿ⁻¹ 到 2ⁿ⁻¹ - 1</p><p>适用场景：温度、坐标偏移、时间差、任何可能为负的数学运算</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"21de4e70-8e35-4306-bca3-18bbe5790ea8"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>i8 </p><p>u8&nbsp;&nbsp;进行举例：</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"f7c175c4-36bd-4490-a5da-8af41afc5a7e"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>无符号 u8:</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[0][0][0][0][0][0][0][0] = 0</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[1][1][1][1][1][1][1][1] = 255</p><p>有符号 i8:</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[0][1][1][1][1][1][1][1] = +127</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[1][0][0][0][0][0][0][0] = -128 ← 最高位1表示负数</p>","uid":"b6d9f8ee-2ad0-43f8-aefe-d04a0817410e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>浮点数</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8c8c9252-1ea4-4f7d-9df4-d68bbff1440a"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>f32和f64</p>","uid":"edca2019-abc5-4d56-9229-027aebeb5a87","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>整数字面量的辅助写法</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"9b1da176-f657-40e1-b56c-457454e4e290"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>rust里面为了可读性，编写整数字面量</p>","uid":"3ec20ef8-1867-4cec-9605-920885922c4f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>个人很少用到</p>","uid":"a24d5925-063b-4c7b-ad49-2be5b7cd5853","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_cdb2d62d-f7c1-4283-877c-8f0e3a577e44","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":589.728142233456,"height":111.6845262192485,"custom":true}},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>布尔类型(bool)</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"0ba086fb-96e3-46f3-97ad-e5068aaea140"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>true和false</p>","uid":"c45f5109-1a94-4632-ba47-42916bf62d6a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>字符类型</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"63d10d23-2cca-42ab-9071-7e663dd522c2"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>char</p>","uid":"f66fa80e-2065-42ea-8f63-d7d7774cf1aa","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>单个Unicode 字符</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;‘&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;’</p>","uid":"e1c9f618-048a-43b7-94e2-372f05b3e9ec","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>‘A’</p>","uid":"829cb46d-827b-481a-9288-4477eae61e0e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>char在内存中总占用4个字节大小</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"ad05c549-cba3-49e0-b1c9-04cb77fcbe7c"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>单元类型</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a06e0081-1e13-4236-abdd-bd713b0afa35"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>字符串</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d44508c0-e463-42c2-b203-387df6a0a788"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>String</p>","uid":"6db34f52-e835-436d-ba28-a7c951b6a20a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>rust支持UTF-8编码，各国语言</p>","uid":"b5f274a0-7879-4752-999b-cedf4f430185","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>String不是char的数组</p><p>不能根据数组下标进行访问</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"bb8eeedd-5796-42ea-9824-2c1cfa2ce0a3"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>let hello = String::from(\"你好\");</p><p>let a = hello[0]; </p>","uid":"6a425eaa-9c20-46a5-9e07-6dabf03a270e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>为什么不行？</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a16c3214-9208-4609-9fa1-7f7e793608b2"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>因为 String 存储的 Unicode 序列的 UTF8 编码，而 UTF8 编码是变长编码。这样即使能访问成功，也只能取出一个字符的 UTF8 编码的第一个字节，它很可能是没有意义的。</p>","uid":"06a008c4-231f-4947-a242-65eebaa0a534","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>字符串字面量中转义</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"b93f13c8-564d-4adc-97db-fba35e5d8b09"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>\\</p>","uid":"41bdbcf1-e0d9-4e7f-b85d-6538259af929","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>pub fn string_out() {</p><p> // 将\"\"号进行转义</p><p> let byte_escape = \"I'm saying \\\"Hello\\\"\";</p><p> println!(\"{}\", byte_escape);</p><p> // 分两行打印</p><p> let byte_escape = \"I'm saying \\n 你好\";</p><p> println!(\"{}\", byte_escape);</p><p> // Windows下的换行符</p><p> let byte_escape = \"I'm saying \\r\\n 你好\";</p><p> println!(\"{}\", byte_escape);</p><p> // 打印出 \\ 本身</p><p> let byte_escape = \"I'm saying \\\\ Ok\";</p><p> println!(\"{}\", byte_escape);</p><p> // 强行在字符串后面加个0，与C语言的字符串一致。</p><p> let byte_escape = \"I'm saying hello.\\0\";println!(\"{}\", byte_escape);</p><p> //一般与c语言使用的是CString</p><p>}</p><p><br></p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a2070d93-864d-41a6-baf0-038d35ddfd06"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>禁止转义的字符串字面量</p><p>告诉编译器原始输出</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"5c2f7d2f-2ac9-4c58-b2cc-ca39616150db"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>r\"\"或r#\"\"#</p>","uid":"e4fd292c-e18e-4871-9e9e-4ef522379df3","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>字节串</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"94b425db-4dfc-42d4-a51d-07215195f505"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>字符串字面量（String Literal） 是指直接写在源代码中的、用引号括起来的固定文本</p>","uid":"aa1f2594-b049-41fe-bc71-76371095fbbf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>字节串。用 b 开头，双引号括起来</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"2d1b55d0-28a8-446e-be6b-aed3877331c5"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>\"this isa byte string\"</p>","uid":"3bf38083-fcb1-47b1-98f3-8ad6ac909f84","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>字节的数组 [u8; N]</p>","uid":"0486a005-aaf1-498d-9288-44ec6530df99","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>很多时候，我们的字符串字面量中用不到 Unicode 字符，只需要 ASCII 字符集。对于这种情况，Rust 还有一种更紧凑的表示法：字节串</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7267bc63-15de-4f92-bcb3-c4c8bfec8832"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>用途：系统编程，网络协议开发</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"cc970fe6-6ed0-4ef7-954d-1aeebb9fc251"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>数组</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a915466f-6c00-46ee-b1f8-3edc93f5aa6b"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>array类型，存储同一类型的多个值，固定长度</p>","uid":"12c2a800-6bd5-423f-9e6b-f132c67e96d1","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>数组表示成[T;N]</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"0f996f3d-57b2-44cb-8cd9-0e80e55cc254"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>数组访问</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4a1acf7f-7420-4171-9e44-ecb083a9c5c7"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>下标索引</p>","uid":"bf330daa-4b72-4766-baa9-883eb80c8421","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>a[0]</p>","uid":"d55552bd-30c8-440b-8f0e-a30b32817b36","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>动态数组</p>","uid":"52d1f20b-ba1a-498f-8f86-2d737770646e","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Vec向量</p>","uid":"6d8a0729-bc54-49d6-aa89-9daaa6912195","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>fn main() {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let v: Vec&lt;i32&gt; = Vec::new();</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let v = vec![1, 2, 3];</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let mut v = Vec::new();</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;v.push(5);</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;v.push(6);</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;v.push(7);v.push(8);</p><p>}</p>","uid":"52739a3e-cfd2-4821-82df-1957ca8d5cbc","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>动态数组可以用下标进行索引访问</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a89f7431-d024-4a5b-aca5-e3df5f9e4cad"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>问题？</p><p>为什么 array 的越界访问能在编译阶段检查出来，而 Vec 的越界访问不能在编译阶段检查出来呢</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"71ba92f3-2416-4cf8-b31e-605e1df84710"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>无论数组还是 Vec，都应优先使用 .get() 或迭代器来避免越界风险</p>","uid":"255123b2-fded-49a1-a0ca-b38561b43756","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>哈希表</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"364c8af3-6fb9-4b3f-8e7b-4b74c6320c53"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>存储key-value 映射关系</p>","uid":"ed7f66e7-a3d3-4abb-97f6-039475bb135d","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>fn main() {</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;use std::collections::HashMap;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;let mut scores = HashMap::new();</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;scores.insert(String::from(\"Blue\"), 10);</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;scores.insert(String::from(\"Yellow\"), 50);</p><p>}</p><p><br></p>","uid":"01ab080e-fd6a-4564-91c5-404acf6fe34b","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>复合类型</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d5bc398a-7b16-4b02-bcc8-79b3166ba4c2"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>元组</p>","uid":"9027a38d-dfbb-4788-a7f0-52e6f53e890f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>固定（元素）长度的列表</p>","uid":"d16c6900-7b37-47da-b4fb-52d7ac0a25a5","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"generalization":[]},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>结构体</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"2d8f1807-6542-4d40-924b-6f704a5e1cf1"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>struct关键字，积类型</p>","uid":"00ef2a75-36cc-4748-ae88-55be07177972","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>枚举</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"b343b40f-4a0d-49ce-bc4d-49dd75bfacc3"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>enum关键字，和类型</p>","uid":"3c172397-6626-4873-bb2d-5e1a491d019b","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>控制流</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7e2d414f-8922-4583-9689-576f6d70f58c"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>分支语句</p>","uid":"8c883f78-8de7-4823-a624-8f6c396fab23","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>if else</p>","uid":"cdb164a8-8c26-490c-8769-84a9dc14b7d4","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>构造分支，支持表达式返回</p>","uid":"9dd9a262-d3a8-4b5e-a07a-d72b85409af9","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>循环语句</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"44a0d5fb-e53b-4c81-bd76-016f20fb1952"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>loop</p>","uid":